#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""NewsLens NL-17 twin-move PROPOSAL launcher.

Thin on purpose (the scripts/doctor + scripts/nl17-backfill pattern): bootstraps
sys.path, then delegates to src/newslens/vocab_move.py, where all the logic
lives and is offline-testable.

    scripts/nl17-vocabulary-move                    # print the pilot proposal
    scripts/nl17-vocabulary-move --tier all         # every enumerated mover
    scripts/nl17-vocabulary-move --out DIR          # + backup, reverse script

READ-ONLY on sources.yaml and $0. It NEVER edits sources.yaml and NEVER writes a
vocabulary_moves row — the ledger row IS the switch, so writing one would BE the
move. The proposal is the principal's to bless item by item.
"""

